MOSS Mini
Copyright 2026 QinXi and contributors.

This community project builds on OpenMOSS/MOSS-Image, licensed under Apache-2.0:
https://github.com/OpenMOSS/MOSS-Image

The streamed loading and quantization modules are extracted and adapted from
our MOSS-Image community engineering work. Changes include packed INT6/INT4
text weights, portable source identities, and a separate-process CLI.

MOSS Mini imports OrbitQuant and Comfy Kitchen as separately installed
dependencies; their code and binary libraries are not vendored here.
Their own licenses apply. Model weights and custom pipeline code are downloaded
separately from OpenMOSS-Team/MOSS-Image-SFT and retain their upstream terms.
This repository does not redistribute model weights and is not an official
OpenMOSS release. The comparison JPEGs are generated outputs, not model weights.
